<title>MALAYSIA: Landmarks year net up 9 pct.</title>
<headline>Landmarks year net up 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  42.17   vs	  38.67</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 10.0    vs	   9.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		   253.87   vs	 154.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    77.52   vs	  61.18</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  7.44   vs  less   7.31</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    6.89   vs	   0.93</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 6.0    vs	   --</p>
<p>NOTE - Landmarks Bhd is a hotel and property developer.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
